TEXT 744 1552 Left 2 !.meas TRAN V PP V(Vc, Vd) FROM 5u TO 10u
TEXT -648 1760 Left 2 !.func F(phi) {if(phi <= 0, exp(phi), {epsilon}*erf(phi_t(phi)) + exp(phi)*erfc({epsilon}*phi_t(phi)))}
