TEXT 1624 1504 Left 2 ;MODELS -------------------------------------------------------
TEXT -1400 1904 Left 2 !.param T = 17406.8
TEXT -1400 1824 Left 2 !.param Vs = 5 * T * Kb
TEXT -1400 1624 Left 2 !.param Ap = 5e-6
